# /design is read-only

`/design` is the Naturinfo prototype and a reference implementation. Do not modify it.

- Do not edit, create, delete, or reformat files under `/design`.
- Do not install packages or change configuration inside `/design`.
- When production should reuse prototype UI, implement that outside `/design`.
- If prototype behaviour conflicts with `docs/naturinfo/`, follow the docs.

```text
Allowed: read design/app/art/page.tsx, then change a production file outside /design
Forbidden: any write under /design, including formatting or dependency updates
```
